                "title": "Teton 1 Inch Square Door Pull",
                "description": "This modern door pull features offset wrap-around mounts. The Teton 1 Inch Square Door Pull can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted. Choose from 12 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. A contemporarily designed pull like this one is great for use on store-front doors. It offers a sleek appearance and it is durable \r\n",
